# Ground item spawns of mapsquare (43,53).
# Merlin's Crystal: the bucket by the beehives and the insect repellent are 289's
# spawns (m43_53.jm2). The 2011 wiki's Merlin's Crystal (2011-05-16) has both: "In a
# house just north of the bank you can find a bottle of insect repellent on a table"
# (cache 786's map has a table, bigtable2, on 289's tile) and a bucket "that spawns
# on the south end of the east fence of the apiary" (289's tile is on that fence).
0 14 49: bucket_empty 1
0 55 58: insect_repellent 1
